  <body dur="02:47.840">
    <div begin="00:00.540" end="02:47.840">
      <p begin="00:00.540" end="00:07.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.540" end="00:00.930">И</span> <span begin="00:01.100" end="00:01.700">не</span><span begin="00:01.700" end="00:01.750">т</span> <span begin="00:02.220" end="00:02.620">ни</span><span begin="00:02.710" end="00:03.170">че</span><span begin="00:03.280" end="00:03.710">го</span> <span begin="00:04.180" end="00:04.270">к</span><span begin="00:04.270" end="00:04.690">ро</span><span begin="00:04.770" end="00:05.180">ме</span> <span begin="00:05.350" end="00:07.250">не</span><span begin="00:07.400" end="00:07.830">ба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除了天空 便再无他物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">除了天空 便再無他物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And there is nothing but the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">空のほかには何もない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘 외에는 아무것도 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et il n'y a rien d'autre que le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y no hay nada más que el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und da ist nichts außer dem Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E não há nada além do céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E non c'è nient'altro che il cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I net nichego krome neba</span></p>
      <p begin="00:08.610" end="00:16.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:08.610" end="00:09.010">Вы</span><span begin="00:09.490" end="00:10.360">со</span><span begin="00:10.490" end="00:10.960">ко</span><span begin="00:11.020" end="00:11.400">го</span> <span begin="00:11.520" end="00:12.040">ти</span><span begin="00:12.580" end="00:13.010">хо</span><span begin="00:13.080" end="00:13.470">го</span> <span begin="00:13.610" end="00:15.230">бе</span><span begin="00:15.230" end="00:15.570">ло</span><span begin="00:15.720" end="00:16.100">го</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那般高远 那般寂静 那般洁白</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那般高遠 那般寂靜 那般潔白</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So high so still so white</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">高く 静かで 真っ白な空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">높고 고요하고 새하얀 하늘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si haut si silencieux si blanc</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tan alto tan silencioso tan blanco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So hoch so still so weiß</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão alto tão silencioso tão branco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così alto così silenzioso così bianco</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Vysokogo tikhogo belogo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:17.380" end="00:25.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:17.380" end="00:17.770">Пол</span><span begin="00:17.890" end="00:18.540">зу</span><span begin="00:18.540" end="00:18.580">т</span> <span begin="00:18.940" end="00:19.480">о</span><span begin="00:19.550" end="00:19.660">б</span><span begin="00:19.660" end="00:19.890">ла</span><span begin="00:20.030" end="00:20.560">ка</span> <span begin="00:21.020" end="00:21.250">бе</span><span begin="00:21.250" end="00:21.440">с</span><span begin="00:21.500" end="00:21.910">ко</span><span begin="00:22.040" end="00:23.950">не</span><span begin="00:23.950" end="00:24.100">ч</span><span begin="00:24.220" end="00:25.240">но</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">云层缓缓流转 仿佛永无尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">雲層緩緩流轉 彷彿永無盡頭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The clouds drift endlessly onward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">雲は果てしなく這うように流れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">구름은 끝없이 느릿느릿 흘러가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les nuages dérivent sans fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las nubes se arrastran sin fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Wolken ziehen endlos dahin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As nuvens se arrastam sem fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le nuvole scorrono lente senza fine</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Polzut oblaka beskonechno</span></p>
      <p begin="00:25.240" end="00:33.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:25.240" end="00:25.440">И</span> <span begin="00:26.280" end="00:27.240">Мы</span><span begin="00:27.240" end="00:27.480">с</span><span begin="00:27.480" end="00:27.710">ли</span> <span begin="00:27.710" end="00:27.950">с</span><span begin="00:27.950" end="00:28.480">та</span><span begin="00:28.480" end="00:29.230">но</span><span begin="00:29.230" end="00:29.510">вят</span><span begin="00:29.510" end="00:30.120">ся</span> <span begin="00:30.120" end="00:30.320">бе</span><span begin="00:30.320" end="00:30.600">с</span><span begin="00:30.600" end="00:31.930">пе</span><span begin="00:31.930" end="00:32.060">ч</span><span begin="00:32.060" end="00:33.100">ны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思绪也渐渐变得无忧无虑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">思緒也漸漸變得無憂無慮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And our thoughts grow carefree</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">思いもいつしか憂いを忘れてゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">생각마저 점점 근심을 잊어 가네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et les pensées deviennent insouciantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y los pensamientos se vuelven despreocupados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die Gedanken werden unbeschwert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E os pensamentos se tornam despreocupados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E i pensieri si fanno spensierati</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I mysli stanovyatsya bespechny</span></p>
      <p begin="00:34.280" end="00:41.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:34.280" end="00:34.630">Не</span> <span begin="00:34.800" end="00:35.690">ви</span><span begin="00:35.790" end="00:36.310">де</span><span begin="00:36.380" end="00:36.810">ли</span> <span begin="00:36.870" end="00:37.380">ран</span><span begin="00:37.920" end="00:38.430">ьше</span> <span begin="00:38.510" end="00:38.890">мы</span> <span begin="00:39.080" end="00:40.920">не</span><span begin="00:41.090" end="00:41.540">ба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从前的我们 不曾见过这样的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">從前的我們 不曾見過這樣的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We had never seen the sky before</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">かつて私たちはこんな空を知らなかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">예전의 우리는 이런 하늘을 본 적이 없었어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous n'avions jamais vu un tel ciel auparavant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Antes nunca habíamos visto el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Einen solchen Himmel hatten wir früher nie gesehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Antes nunca tínhamos visto o céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Prima non avevamo mai visto un cielo simile</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ne videli ran'she my neba</span></p>
      <p begin="00:42.180" end="00:50.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:42.180" end="00:42.510">Не</span> <span begin="00:42.980" end="00:43.100">з</span><span begin="00:43.140" end="00:44.190">на</span><span begin="00:44.190" end="00:44.640">ли</span> <span begin="00:44.730" end="00:45.080">мы</span> <span begin="00:45.080" end="00:45.120">г</span><span begin="00:45.210" end="00:45.660">де</span> <span begin="00:46.380" end="00:46.720">и</span><span begin="00:46.720" end="00:46.850">с</span><span begin="00:46.920" end="00:47.220">ка</span><span begin="00:47.280" end="00:47.500">ть сч</span><span begin="00:47.500" end="00:49.250">а</span><span begin="00:49.250" end="00:49.440">с</span><span begin="00:49.440" end="00:49.540">т</span><span begin="00:49.540" end="00:50.000">ья</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不知该去何处寻觅幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">也不知該去何處尋覓幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We never knew where to find happiness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">幸せをどこに探せばいいのかも知らなかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">행복을 어디서 찾아야 할지도 몰랐어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous ne savions pas où chercher le bonheur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No sabíamos dónde buscar la felicidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir wussten nicht wo wir das Glück suchen sollten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não sabíamos onde procurar a felicidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non sapevamo dove cercare la felicità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ne znali my gde iskat' schast'ya</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.130" end="00:58.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:51.130" end="00:51.500">А</span> <span begin="00:51.640" end="00:52.490">ве</span><span begin="00:52.590" end="00:53.040">тер</span> <span begin="00:53.190" end="00:53.480">тот</span> <span begin="00:53.680" end="00:54.190">дул</span> <span begin="00:54.730" end="00:55.060">та</span><span begin="00:55.060" end="00:55.110">к</span> <span begin="00:55.110" end="00:55.300">с</span><span begin="00:55.300" end="00:55.730">ви</span><span begin="00:55.770" end="00:57.680">ре</span><span begin="00:57.900" end="00:58.990">по</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而那时的风 却呼啸得如此凛冽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">而那時的風 卻呼嘯得如此凜冽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Yet the wind blew so fiercely back then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの頃の風はあまりにも激しく吹き荒れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그때 바람은 그토록 사납게 불었고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et ce vent soufflait avec tant de fureur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aquel viento soplaba con tanta ferocidad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch jener Wind wehte so erbarmungslos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E aquele vento soprava com tanta fúria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E quel vento soffiava così ferocemente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">A veter tot dul tak svirepo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:58.990" end="01:06.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:58.990" end="00:59.180">И</span> <span begin="01:00.020" end="01:00.920">ну</span><span begin="01:00.920" end="01:01.020">ж</span><span begin="01:01.100" end="01:01.650">но</span> <span begin="01:01.650" end="01:01.890">и</span><span begin="01:02.100" end="01:02.460">дти</span> <span begin="01:03.210" end="01:03.720">бы</span><span begin="01:03.720" end="01:04.040">ло</span> <span begin="01:04.200" end="01:06.200">дал</span><span begin="01:06.200" end="01:06.380">ьш</span><span begin="01:06.450" end="01:06.670">е</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们仍不得不继续前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們仍不得不繼續前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And we had no choice but to keep moving forward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも歩み続けなければならなかった</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리는 계속 나아가야만 했어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et pourtant il nous fallait continuer d'avancer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y aun así teníamos que seguir adelante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und wir mussten dennoch weitergehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E ainda precisávamos seguir em frente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E dovevamo continuare ad andare avanti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I nuzhno idti bylo dal'she</span></p>
      <p begin="01:07.920" end="01:15.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:07.920" end="01:08.170">А</span><span begin="01:08.170" end="01:08.270">х</span> <span begin="01:08.380" end="01:09.370">ка</span><span begin="01:09.370" end="01:09.460">к</span> <span begin="01:09.460" end="01:09.890">же</span> <span begin="01:10.000" end="01:10.370">то</span><span begin="01:10.370" end="01:10.410">г</span><span begin="01:10.500" end="01:10.990">да</span> <span begin="01:11.480" end="01:11.940">за</span><span begin="01:12.010" end="01:12.110">б</span><span begin="01:12.110" end="01:12.380">лу</span><span begin="01:12.380" end="01:12.520">ж</span><span begin="01:12.590" end="01:14.780">да</span><span begin="01:14.780" end="01:15.080">ли</span><span begin="01:15.350" end="01:15.460">сь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 那时的我们竟错得如此之深</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">啊 那時的我們竟錯得如此之深</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Oh how mistaken we were back then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ あの頃の私たちはどれほど思い違いをしていたのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아 그때 우리는 얼마나 잘못 알고 있었던 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ah comme nous nous trompions alors</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ah cuánto nos equivocábamos entonces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ach wie sehr wir uns damals irrten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah como estávamos enganados naquela época</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ah quanto ci sbagliavamo allora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Akh kak zhe togda zabluzhdalis'</span></p>
      <p begin="01:16.330" end="01:23.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:16.330" end="01:16.690">Ко</span><span begin="01:16.690" end="01:16.790">г</span><span begin="01:16.790" end="01:17.800">да</span> <span begin="01:17.880" end="01:18.380">на</span> <span begin="01:18.440" end="01:18.930">до</span><span begin="01:18.970" end="01:19.440">ро</span><span begin="01:19.970" end="01:20.370">ге</span> <span begin="01:20.470" end="01:20.520">п</span><span begin="01:20.520" end="01:20.800">ро</span><span begin="01:20.800" end="01:21.060">щ</span><span begin="01:21.060" end="01:23.190">а</span><span begin="01:23.190" end="01:23.470">ли</span><span begin="01:23.680" end="01:23.800">сь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我们在漫漫长路上挥手作别</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當我們在漫漫長路上揮手作別</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When we said our goodbyes along the road</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あの道で別れを告げた時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">길 위에서 서로 작별을 나누던 그때</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Lorsque nous nous faisions nos adieux sur la route</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando nos despedíamos en el camino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als wir auf dem Weg Abschied voneinander nahmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando nos despedíamos na estrada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando ci dicevamo addio lungo la strada</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kogda na doroge proshchalis'</span></p>
      <p begin="01:24.750" end="01:31.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:24.750" end="01:25.060">Не</span> <span begin="01:25.060" end="01:25.200">ж</span><span begin="01:25.250" end="01:26.310">да</span><span begin="01:26.310" end="01:26.750">ли</span> <span begin="01:26.820" end="01:27.100">мы</span> <span begin="01:27.100" end="01:27.290">с</span><span begin="01:27.350" end="01:27.890">ко</span><span begin="01:28.370" end="01:28.420">р</span><span begin="01:28.420" end="01:28.710">ы</span><span begin="01:28.710" end="01:28.800">х</span> <span begin="01:28.920" end="01:29.250">по</span><span begin="01:29.320" end="01:29.490">т</span><span begin="01:29.490" end="01:31.540">е</span><span begin="01:31.540" end="01:31.860">рь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未曾料到 失去竟会来得如此仓促</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">未曾料到 失去竟會來得如此倉促</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We never expected loss to come so soon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">間もなく訪れる喪失など思いもせずに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">곧 닥쳐올 상실을 예상하지 못했어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous ne pressentions pas les pertes si proches</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No esperábamos pérdidas tan próximas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir ahnten nicht dass uns bald Verluste bevorstanden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não esperávamos perdas tão próximas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non ci aspettavamo perdite così imminenti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ne zhdali my skorykh poter'</span></p>
      <p begin="01:33.110" end="01:40.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:33.110" end="01:33.550">Бе</span><span begin="01:33.550" end="01:33.710">ж</span><span begin="01:33.710" end="01:34.620">и</span><span begin="01:34.620" end="01:34.660">т</span> <span begin="01:34.770" end="01:35.240">по</span> <span begin="01:35.310" end="01:35.770">зе</span><span begin="01:35.770" end="01:35.870">м</span><span begin="01:35.870" end="01:36.200">ле</span> <span begin="01:36.630" end="01:36.700">к</span><span begin="01:36.700" end="01:36.970">рыл</span><span begin="01:36.970" end="01:37.370">а</span><span begin="01:37.470" end="01:37.760">тый</span> <span begin="01:37.760" end="01:37.950">з</span><span begin="01:37.950" end="01:39.950">ве</span><span begin="01:39.950" end="01:40.220">рь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生有双翼的野兽 仍在大地上奔行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">生有雙翼的野獸 仍在大地上奔行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A winged beast runs across the earth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">翼を持つ獣が大地を駆けてゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">날개 달린 짐승이 땅 위를 달려가네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une bête ailée court sur la terre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una bestia alada corre sobre la tierra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein geflügeltes Tier rennt über die Erde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma fera alada corre sobre a terra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sulla terra corre una bestia alata</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Bezhit po zemle krylatyy zver'</span></p>
      <p begin="01:58.460" end="02:05.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:58.460" end="01:58.820">И</span> <span begin="01:59.010" end="01:59.600">не</span><span begin="01:59.650" end="01:59.680">т</span> <span begin="02:00.060" end="02:00.440">ни</span><span begin="02:00.570" end="02:00.990">че</span><span begin="02:01.120" end="02:01.580">го</span> <span begin="02:02.030" end="02:02.120">к</span><span begin="02:02.120" end="02:02.570">ро</span><span begin="02:02.640" end="02:03.060">ме</span> <span begin="02:03.240" end="02:05.220">не</span><span begin="02:05.360" end="02:05.770">ба</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">除了天空 便再无他物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">除了天空 便再無他物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And there is nothing but the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">空のほかには何もない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘 외에는 아무것도 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et il n'y a rien d'autre que le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y no hay nada más que el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und da ist nichts außer dem Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E não há nada além do céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E non c'è nient'altro che il cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I net nichego krome neba</span></p>
      <p begin="02:06.350" end="02:14.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="02:06.350" end="02:06.840">Вы</span><span begin="02:07.310" end="02:08.350">со</span><span begin="02:08.440" end="02:08.940">ко</span><span begin="02:09.000" end="02:09.410">го</span> <span begin="02:09.530" end="02:10.040">ти</span><span begin="02:10.520" end="02:10.980">хо</span><span begin="02:11.030" end="02:11.470">го</span> <span begin="02:11.570" end="02:13.190">бе</span><span begin="02:13.190" end="02:13.600">ло</span><span begin="02:13.710" end="02:14.370">го</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那般高远 那般寂静 那般洁白</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那般高遠 那般寂靜 那般潔白</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So high so still so white</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">高く 静かで 真っ白な空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">높고 고요하고 새하얀 하늘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si haut si silencieux si blanc</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tan alto tan silencioso tan blanco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So hoch so still so weiß</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tão alto tão silencioso tão branco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così alto così silenzioso così bianco</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Vysokogo tikhogo belogo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:15.750" end="02:22.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="02:15.750" end="02:16.720">Сер</span><span begin="02:16.720" end="02:16.880">д</span><span begin="02:16.880" end="02:17.270">це</span> <span begin="02:17.380" end="02:17.430">п</span><span begin="02:17.430" end="02:17.740">рон</span><span begin="02:17.880" end="02:18.970">за</span><span begin="02:18.970" end="02:19.120">ет</span> <span begin="02:19.420" end="02:19.470">т</span><span begin="02:19.470" end="02:19.880">ре</span><span begin="02:20.000" end="02:21.930">во</span><span begin="02:22.080" end="02:22.550">га</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忧惧如利刃般刺透心房</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">憂懼如利刃般刺透心房</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Dread pierces the heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">不安が胸を突き刺す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">불안이 가슴을 꿰뚫고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L'angoisse transperce mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La angustia atraviesa el corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Angst durchbohrt das Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A angústia trespassa o coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L'angoscia trafigge il cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Serdtse pronzaet trevoga</span></p>
      <p begin="02:24.180" end="02:30.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:24.180" end="02:24.510">Мо</span><span begin="02:24.510" end="02:24.680">е</span><span begin="02:24.730" end="02:25.180">го</span> <span begin="02:25.240" end="02:25.690">не</span> <span begin="02:25.690" end="02:25.950">о</span><span begin="02:25.950" end="02:26.170">с</span><span begin="02:26.240" end="02:27.230">та</span><span begin="02:27.310" end="02:27.510">не</span><span begin="02:27.730" end="02:28.050">тся</span> <span begin="02:28.580" end="02:30.430">до</span><span begin="02:30.570" end="02:30.920">ма</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的家终将不复存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的家終將不復存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There will be no home left for me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私の帰る家はもう残らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내게는 더 이상 집이 남아 있지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il ne restera rien de mon foyer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no me quedará un hogar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Von meinem Zuhause wird nichts mehr übrig bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu lar já não existirá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non avrò più una casa da chiamare mia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Moego ne ostanetsya doma</span></p>
      <p begin="02:32.600" end="02:39.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:32.600" end="02:33.600">Сер</span><span begin="02:33.600" end="02:33.750">д</span><span begin="02:33.750" end="02:34.160">це</span> <span begin="02:34.270" end="02:34.320">п</span><span begin="02:34.320" end="02:34.590">рон</span><span begin="02:34.760" end="02:35.800">за</span><span begin="02:35.800" end="02:35.960">ет</span> <span begin="02:36.240" end="02:36.290">т</span><span begin="02:36.290" end="02:36.720">ре</span><span begin="02:36.840" end="02:38.790">во</span><span begin="02:38.920" end="02:39.260">га</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忧惧如利刃般刺透心房</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">憂懼如利刃般刺透心房</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Dread pierces the heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">不安が胸を突き刺す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">불안이 가슴을 꿰뚫고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L'angoisse transperce mon cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La angustia atraviesa el corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Angst durchbohrt das Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A angústia trespassa o coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L'angoscia trafigge il cuore</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Serdtse pronzaet trevoga</span></p>
      <p begin="02:41.070" end="02:47.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:41.070" end="02:41.340">Мо</span><span begin="02:41.340" end="02:41.510">е</span><span begin="02:41.560" end="02:42.040">го</span> <span begin="02:42.100" end="02:42.560">не</span> <span begin="02:42.560" end="02:42.800">о</span><span begin="02:42.800" end="02:43.050">с</span><span begin="02:43.100" end="02:44.180">та</span><span begin="02:44.230" end="02:44.460">не</span><span begin="02:44.640" end="02:44.990">тся</span> <span begin="02:45.730" end="02:47.280">до</span><span begin="02:47.420" end="02:47.840">ма</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的家终将不复存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的家終將不復存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There will be no home left for me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私の帰る家はもう残らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내게는 더 이상 집이 남아 있지 않겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il ne restera rien de mon foyer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ya no me quedará un hogar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Von meinem Zuhause wird nichts mehr übrig bleiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Meu lar já não existirá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non avrò più una casa da chiamare mia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Moego ne ostanetsya doma</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
